  "_about": "Validation targets for replicating Singh & Bagler (2018) on CulinaryDB. Values were read by eye from the CulinaryDB website figures (data/raw/culinarydb_site/figures/2FP-R0..R3.png, X-Positive/Negative-Food-Pairing-Statistics.png) on 2026-11-22. Reading error: about +-3 for random/category Z, +-0.7 for frequency and frequency+category Z, +-0.1 for contributions. Use them for sign agreement, rank correlation and tolerance checks, not exact equality.",
  "_z_definition": "Z = sqrt(N_rand) * (mean_Ns_cuisine - mean_Ns_rand) / sigma_rand, with N_rand = 100000 random recipes and sigma_rand the SD of recipe-level Ns in the random cuisine (Jain, Rakhi & Bagler 2015, eq. 3; Singh & Bagler 2018). Each panel compares the REAL cuisine with one null model built from that cuisine's own ingredients and recipe-size distribution.",
